        "tab_4QNJih": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "Shipping",
            "tab_detail": "<p><strong>Shipping Policy</strong></p><ul><li>Orders ship within 1 business day after payment clears (weekend/holiday orders included); small packages go via USPS, UPS, or FedEx, while large items (engines, transmissions, body panels, axles, exhausts, interiors, cradles, etc.) ship via freight.</li><li>Small package rates are based on destination ZIP code and cover the lower 48 states only; freight and residential deliveries require a quote before purchase.</li><li>Freight transit can take up to 7 business days; small package delivery timing depends on the carrier.</li><li>Locations without a dock or forklift need liftgate service for freight — this must be disclosed at time of purchase.</li><li>Expedited shipping (small packages only) may be available at extra cost — contact us before buying to confirm; fees are non-refundable.</li><li>International buyers are responsible for all shipping costs, taxes, and customs fees, and we reserve the right to select or change carriers as needed.</li><li>Local pickup is available for all items — contact us in advance so the order can be prepared.</li></ul><p>Fast, Secure, Nation-wide Delivery. We partner with trusted logistics providers to ensure your parts arrive promptly and in excellent condition.</p>",
            "tab_liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "tab_html": "",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_GUc6Ly": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "tab_title": "Warranty",
            "tab_detail": "<p><strong>Warranty Details</strong></p><ul><li>This part includes a 1-Year Limited Warranty from the date of purchase. This is the sole and exclusive warranty provided for this part.</li><li>If the part is defective during the warranty period, we will replace the part or refund the purchase price. This warranty applies to the part only and does not cover labor, installation, fluids, accessories, or incidental expenses.</li><li>The warranty is void if the part is installed incorrectly, misused, abused, modified, or if proper maintenance is not followed. Engines and transmissions must be installed by a certified repair facility. All parts are sold as tested and inspected for functionality; the installer is responsible for fitment verification.</li><li>Airbags and SRS components are sold AS IS with no warranty. Sheet metal parts are warranted only against factory corrosion under normal use.</li></ul>",
            "tab_liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "tab_html": "",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
